                                "sense_id": "f4fc31e5-cfe0-3663-bf4c-90b1e7772463",
                                "text": "Each of these concepts can be used, and is used, to justify the various overpowerings and abuses that are typical of capitalism as we know it, pace the Enlightenment thinkers and any other ideal model."
